WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:04.594
- [Narrator] This is what a
typical bodega sounds like.

00:00:04.594 --> 00:00:06.130
(cash register opening)
(cat meowing)

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:09.105
But this bodega sounds a little different.

00:00:09.105 --> 00:00:12.188
(bouncy Latin music)

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.270
- [Narrator] Almost every
street corner in New York City

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:28.160
has a small store with
sandwiches, groceries, and drinks.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.633
This is a bodega.

00:00:34.395 --> 00:00:35.965
- [Director] Cut.

00:00:35.965 --> 00:00:36.798
- OK.

00:01:31.985 --> 00:01:35.402
(variety of Latin music)

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:38.103
(bell chiming)

